      "cat-harness:section": "Same turn, quoted, dated — in the provenance log",
      "prov:value": "I didn't want provenance deleted completely. I just wanted it removed from within the narrative of the text. There should be log of the changes, that could be through git. But in particular, if there is a reasoning given for why a change was made that should be preserved in the narrative.  There could be a provenance log associated to the document and rendered as part of the footer that contains this information",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
